This covers the pack's own work: configs, KubeJS scripts, the Patchouli book, the
lucky block addons written for it, and the addon patch files. It does NOT cover the
third-party mods listed in manifest.json, nor the lines of community addons quoted
as anchors in overrides/config/luckytweaks/drop_patches/ -- those belong to their
respective authors, and the addons themselves are downloaded from their official
CurseForge files rather than shipped here.

